SPINDLE is released under the Zero-Clause BSD license (0BSD): no attribution, no
notice preservation, no conditions.

That covers the code written for this project: everything under main/, host/,
tools/, components/audio_hal, components/display, components/imu,
components/medal_input, and the files core/tempest.c, core/tempest.h,
core/mathbox.h, core/pokey.c, core/pokey.h, core/avg.h and core/m6502fast.h.

It does not cover core/avg.c and core/mathbox.c, which are ports of MAME
source code (BSD-3-Clause, notice to be kept; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and
the headers of those files).

It does not cover the game ROMs, which are not distributed here and never will
be. See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for the code this project is derived from.

